<section>
  <h2>Voldoende contrast voor tekst</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      tekst kleiner dan 24px: <strong>minimum 4,5</strong>
    </li>
    <li>tekst groter dan 24px: minimum 3</li>
  </ul>
  <aside class="notes">
    The ratio between sizes in points and CSS pixels is 1pt = 1.333px, therefore
    14pt and 18pt are equivalent to approximately 18.5px and 24px.
  </aside>
</section>

